    "updated_at": "2020-01-15T18:26:18Z",
    "body": "Yeah, to be clear here, I'd really love it if before asking for your password, the script explained why it needed admin and what it would do with it. I *mostly* trust installer scripts these days, but it's still a complete PITA when you want to undo them and have no idea what they've done or if they've secretly written data to `/var/` that you don't know about.",
