    "body": "> Another option would be to install to `~/bin` or `~/.local/bin` by default.\r\n\r\nChecking locally, I don't see those paths added to `$PATH` by default, so it may require users having the add new paths to their `$PATH`. I think we should avoid raising the barrier to use Starship if possible.",
